    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/aa8f38eb047db92958462661bd330e09.avif?t=1755052848\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aksun</strong> is a Hack &amp; Slash Roguelite rooted in Korean shamanic folklore. You are trapped inside the Casket - a cursed sealing device forged to imprison the will of a fallen cult and its monstrous prophet. Every run forces you deeper into a cycle of memory, suffering, and rebirth - but also closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ef3e484439ba9fdccd6dd95acc058e10.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCEND INTO THE SEAL OF AKSUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death in Aksun is merely a part of a ritual and every victory peels back a layer of truth. Trapped inside the Seal of Aksun - a cursed prison born from shattered reincarnation - you\u2019ll awaken lost weapons, absorb corrupted artifacts, and fight your way through a world that remembers your every attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREE-DIMENSINAL BUILD SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aksun\u2019s progression is built on the interaction of three core components:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>, bound to Hell Gods, define your combat identity and unlock powerful Awakening Skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong>, crystallized remnants of cult rituals, grant elemental effects, deployable summons, and active chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes</strong>, synergy-based stat modifiers, tie everything together into unpredictable, layered builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.poster.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.webm?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.mp4?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the relationships between these three systems is key to surviving - and breaking - the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ccb004eecbbd9248b43dd579bc5874e1.poster.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ccb004eecbbd9248b43dd579bc5874e1.webm?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELEMENTS IN CONFLICT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Artifact belongs to one of the Five Elements - Fire, Ice, Wind, Earth, or Lightning - and doesn\u2019t just empower you in isolation. Combine them, and you\u2019ll trigger destructive chain reactions: flame igniting storm, lightning crashing through molten stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.poster.avif?t=1755052848\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.webm?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.mp4?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW RUN, NEW BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter is a branching node map. After each stage, choose your next path and reward: strengthen your weapon with Resonance, gain a new Artifact Chime, unlock awakened passives, collect Echoes to shape your stats, or shop for high-risk upgrades. Every death resets your loadout, but each run teaches you more - unlocking smarter, deadlier combinations that evolve your build in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/64b19a619157adf63f7aab713eda9789.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LORE THAT BLEEDS INTO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place inside a distorted echo of the Six Realms of Rebirth - a closed loop designed to punish those who rejected the cycle. The Mokdugi King, once a cult leader, is now its most broken prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every design - from its mechanics to its symbols - is rooted in Korean myths, rituals, and spiritual beliefs: shamanism, elemental balance, divine punishment, and ancestral memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just myth. It\u2019s ritual, played in blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ea94cf50b1b3ee68074a26faf8f049bc.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/aa8f38eb047db92958462661bd330e09.avif?t=1755052848\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aksun</strong> is a Hack &amp; Slash Roguelite rooted in Korean shamanic folklore. You are trapped inside the Casket - a cursed sealing device forged to imprison the will of a fallen cult and its monstrous prophet. Every run forces you deeper into a cycle of memory, suffering, and rebirth - but also closer to mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ef3e484439ba9fdccd6dd95acc058e10.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=380 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESCEND INTO THE SEAL OF AKSUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death in Aksun is merely a part of a ritual and every victory peels back a layer of truth. Trapped inside the Seal of Aksun - a cursed prison born from shattered reincarnation - you\u2019ll awaken lost weapons, absorb corrupted artifacts, and fight your way through a world that remembers your every attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THREE-DIMENSINAL BUILD SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aksun\u2019s progression is built on the interaction of three core components:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>, bound to Hell Gods, define your combat identity and unlock powerful Awakening Skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong>, crystallized remnants of cult rituals, grant elemental effects, deployable summons, and active chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes</strong>, synergy-based stat modifiers, tie everything together into unpredictable, layered builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.poster.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.webm?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/d38e4e0d94f933ba10445c634b1a9061.mp4?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering the relationships between these three systems is key to surviving - and breaking - the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ccb004eecbbd9248b43dd579bc5874e1.poster.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ccb004eecbbd9248b43dd579bc5874e1.webm?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ELEMENTS IN CONFLICT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Artifact belongs to one of the Five Elements - Fire, Ice, Wind, Earth, or Lightning - and doesn\u2019t just empower you in isolation. Combine them, and you\u2019ll trigger destructive chain reactions: flame igniting storm, lightning crashing through molten stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.poster.avif?t=1755052848\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.webm?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/4b9b11c36ddded76ab8ad8e396a6eabd.mp4?t=1755052848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW RUN, NEW BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter is a branching node map. After each stage, choose your next path and reward: strengthen your weapon with Resonance, gain a new Artifact Chime, unlock awakened passives, collect Echoes to shape your stats, or shop for high-risk upgrades. Every death resets your loadout, but each run teaches you more - unlocking smarter, deadlier combinations that evolve your build in unpredictable ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/64b19a619157adf63f7aab713eda9789.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LORE THAT BLEEDS INTO PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game takes place inside a distorted echo of the Six Realms of Rebirth - a closed loop designed to punish those who rejected the cycle. The Mokdugi King, once a cult leader, is now its most broken prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every design - from its mechanics to its symbols - is rooted in Korean myths, rituals, and spiritual beliefs: shamanism, elemental balance, divine punishment, and ancestral memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just myth. It\u2019s ritual, played in blood.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129360/extras/ea94cf50b1b3ee68074a26faf8f049bc.avif?t=1755052848\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Aksun is a Hack &amp; Slash Roguelite with deep builds and chaotic synergies, inspired by Korean shamanic folklore. Awaken divine weapons, absorb elemental artifacts, and unleash devastating reactions as you descend into a cursed cycle of memory, power, and ritual.",
